{
    "id": "engineering_residual_gap",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "depends_on": [
        "gap_awareness"
    ],
    "capability_keys": [
        "engineering_gap_detection"
    ],
    "description": "PROPOSAL 3 (DESIGN_REVIEW_CAPABILITY_EXPANSION_PREREG.md sec4; docs/research/engine_substrate/MEASURED_RESIDUAL_FILING_PREREG.md): the agent's ENGINEERING self, not just its conversational self, gets eyes via gap_awareness.json's own mechanism. A diagnostic script mechanically ingests its already-computed residual population dict as EngineeringResidual fact nodes (domains.engineering_residual_ingest.ingest_taxonomy); THIS seed's rules decide which populations are standing gaps (note_engineering_residual_gap) and retire them on re-measurement (retire_resolved_engineering_residual_gap, the retire_duplicate_gap guard shape pointed at count-went-to-zero instead of duplication). The minted SelfConcern is the SAME node shape every other gap_awareness.json rule mints, so reflective_faculty._run_self_gaps surfaces it and jabberwock_daemon.promote_self_concern promotes it with ZERO new plumbing -- verified by reading both, not assumed.",
    "microtheory": {
        "name": "engineering_residual_gap",
        "description": "a measured engineering-subsystem residual population (a blocker bucket, a priced tier, an Occam-wall population) is a capability gap the agent files on itself, from its own diagnostic scripts' own numbers"
    },
    "nodes": [],
    "edges": [],
    "productions": [],
    "rules": [
        {
            "name": "note_engineering_residual_gap",
            "comment": "MEASURED-RESIDUAL FILING (Proposal 3, DESIGN_REVIEW_CAPABILITY_EXPANSION_PREREG.md sec4): a diagnostic script (scripts/ceiling3_diag_sweep.py, scripts/mbpp_endgame_battery.py) already computes a structured residual population and ingests it MECHANICALLY as an EngineeringResidual fact node (domains.engineering_residual_ingest.ingest_taxonomy -- no interpretation, the numbers are already in a dict). THIS rule DECIDES a nonzero, non-'pass' population is a standing capability gap: it files SelfConcern{status:'noted', source:'implicit', kind:'engineering_residual', content:<population_key>} -- the SAME node shape gap_awareness.json's own gap rules mint, so the surfacing reader (reflective_faculty._run_self_gaps) and the human-gated promote spine (jabberwock_daemon.promote_self_concern) both find it with zero new plumbing. ONE SelfConcern per POPULATION (content = population_key, e.g. 'mbpp_endgame_battery.full:accepted_holdout_fail'), never per task-id -- the design doc's one named granularity risk, closed by construction (this rule matches EngineeringResidual nodes, one per outcome bucket, and never iterates task_ids). 'pass' is excluded by name -- the one hardcoded literal in this seed, the same success sentinel both scripts' own row['outcome']='pass' lines already define; excluding it IS the rule deciding what counts as a residual, never Python. Content-deduped (Not Exists SelfConcern content==X, verbatim note_unresolved_topic_gap/note_solve_exhausted_gap shape) + mint-once via engineering_gap_noted on the EngineeringResidual node, the gap_noted precedent.",
            "match": [
                [
                    "agent",
                    "has_engineering_residual",
                    "er"
                ]
            ],
            "where": {
                "type": "And",
                "items": [
                    {
                        "type": "Not",
                        "arg": {
                            "type": "Eq",
                            "a": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "er"
                                },
                                "key": "count"
                            },
                            "b": {
                                "type": "Lit",
                                "value": 0
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "Not",
                        "arg": {
                            "type": "Eq",
                            "a": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "er"
                                },
                                "key": "outcome"
                            },
                            "b": {
                                "type": "Lit",
                                "value": "pass"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "Not",
                        "arg": {
                            "type": "Eq",
                            "a": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "er"
                                },
                                "key": "engineering_gap_noted"
                            },
                            "b": {
                                "type": "Lit",
                                "value": 1.0
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "Not",
                        "arg": {
                            "type": "Exists",
                            "source": {
                                "type": "NodesOfType",
                                "node_type": "SelfConcern"
                            },
                            "var_name": "sc2",
                            "predicate": {
                                "type": "Eq",
                                "a": {
                                    "type": "Attr",
                                    "node": {
                                        "type": "Var",
                                        "name": "sc2"
                                    },
                                    "key": "content"
                                },
                                "b": {
                                    "type": "Attr",
                                    "node": {
                                        "type": "Var",
                                        "name": "er"
                                    },
                                    "key": "population_key"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "effects": [
                [
                    "set_attr",
                    "er",
                    "engineering_gap_noted",
                    1.0
                ],
                [
                    "add_node",
                    "sc",
                    "SelfConcern",
                    {
                        "status": "noted",
                        "source": "implicit",
                        "kind": "engineering_residual",
                        "content": {
                            "__term__": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "er"
                                },
                                "key": "population_key"
                            }
                        },
                        "count": {
                            "__term__": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "er"
                                },
                                "key": "count"
                            }
                        },
                        "task_ids": {
                            "__term__": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "er"
                                },
                                "key": "task_ids"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ],
                [
                    "add_edge",
                    "agent",
                    "has_self_concern",
                    "sc"
                ],
                [
                    "add_edge",
                    "sc",
                    "about_residual",
                    "er"
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "retire_resolved_engineering_residual_gap",
            "comment": "retire_duplicate_gap's exact guard shape (gap_awareness.json), pointed at RE-MEASUREMENT instead of duplication: a 'engineering_residual' SelfConcern whose population's EngineeringResidual now reads count==0 (the diagnostic script re-ran and the population is empty) is retired -- status='retired' + del_edge has_self_concern, byte-identical effect shape to retire_duplicate_gap. Scoped to kind=='engineering_residual' so it never touches any other concern kind's retire discipline.",
            "match": [
                [
                    "agent",
                    "has_self_concern",
                    "sc"
                ]
            ],
            "where": {
                "type": "And",
                "items": [
                    {
                        "type": "Eq",
                        "a": {
                            "type": "Attr",
                            "node": {
                                "type": "Var",
                                "name": "sc"
                            },
                            "key": "kind"
                        },
                        "b": {
                            "type": "Lit",
                            "value": "engineering_residual"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "Not",
                        "arg": {
                            "type": "Eq",
                            "a": {
                                "type": "Attr",
                                "node": {
                                    "type": "Var",
                                    "name": "sc"
                                },
                                "key": "status"
                            },
                            "b": {
                                "type": "Lit",
                                "value": "retired"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "Exists",
                        "source": {
                            "type": "NodesOfType",
                            "node_type": "EngineeringResidual"
                        },
                        "var_name": "er",
                        "predicate": {
                            "type": "And",
                            "items": [
                                {
                                    "type": "Eq",
                                    "a": {
                                        "type": "Attr",
                                        "node": {
                                            "type": "Var",
                                            "name": "er"
                                        },
                                        "key": "population_key"
                                    },
                                    "b": {
                                        "type": "Attr",
                                        "node": {
                                            "type": "Var",
                                            "name": "sc"
                                        },
                                        "key": "content"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "Eq",
                                    "a": {
                                        "type": "Attr",
                                        "node": {
                                            "type": "Var",
                                            "name": "er"
                                        },
                                        "key": "count"
                                    },
                                    "b": {
                                        "type": "Lit",
                                        "value": 0
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "effects": [
                [
                    "set_attr",
                    "sc",
                    "status",
                    "retired"
                ],
                [
                    "del_edge",
                    "agent",
                    "has_self_concern",
                    "sc"
                ]
            ]
        }
    ]
}
